{"model": "FrostWolfAI/Frost-Cyber-Mini-1.0-MLX", "track": "standard", "task": "std-code-fizzbuzz", "seed": 2, "score": 0.667, "checks": [{"type": "code", "score": 0.667}], "secs": 7.93, "eval_count": 245, "truncated": false, "cut_in_thinking": false, "answer": "```python\ndef fizzbuzz(n: int) -> list[str]:\n    return [\n        'Fizz' if i % 3 == 0 else\n        'Buzz' if i % 5 == 0 else\n        'FizzBuzz' if i % 15 == 0 else str(i)\n        for i in range(1, n + 1)\n    ]\n```"}
